    "detailed_description": "You are trapped in an endless alleyway late at night. <br />\r\nObserve anomalies or differences in the surrounding environment carefully, <br />\r\nand finally reach &quot;Alley Nine&quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOnce approaching and discovering anomalies or differences, immediately turn back.<br />\r\nIf no abnormalities or differences are found, continue moving forward.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u00b72D hand drawn graphics<br />\r\n\u00b7Explore infinite loop small alley scene<br />\r\n\u00b7Find randomly occurring anomalies or differences<br />\r\n\u00b7More than 50 anomalies or differences<br />\r\n\u00b7Some details may challenge your discernment<br />\r\n\u00b7Almost no direct horror elements included<br />\r\n\u00b7Play Time 20-60min",
